  "prompt": "Prove by induction that $24 \\mid (5^{2n} - 1)$ for every integer $n \\ge 0$. Check $n = 0$, assume $5^{2k} - 1 = 24m$ for an integer $m$ (the case $n = k$), and show that $5^{2(k+1)} - 1$ is $24$ times an integer.",
